 "text": "Hi, how are you holding up? Near water source and far from trees, so Athens isn't shaded by sunup to sunset. If you can see it from far off. That's fine as long as the tree isn't going anywhere. Tent poles can also be attached to them. Tent poles can be repositioned. Which is why it' worth keeping the branches in mind when choosing the spot. tent needs air to stay dry, so keep it away from any source of heat. That's easy to beat into shape with ropes and stakes. Just make sure the door can open without getting tangled.",
